<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-JUVENTUS WANT NIGERIAN WEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS WANT NIGERIAN WEST.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian international defender Taribo West is negotiating a move to beaten European Cup finalists Juventus from Auxerre, L'Equipe reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The two clubs have reached an agreement but small details have still to be settled and nothing has been signed yet,&quot; West was quoted as saying..</p>
<p>According to the paper, West would sign a four-year contract in a transfer estimated at 23 million francs ($4 million).</p>
</text>
